    <li>You are claiming unreimbursed employee business expenses.</li>
  </ul>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Caution: You can use the standard mileage rate for 2006 only if: (a) you owed the vehicle and used the standard mileage rate for the first year you used the vehicle, or (b) you leased the vehicle and used the standard mileage rate for the portion of the lease period after 1997.</p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 25px;">Part I Figure Your Expenses</h3>

